                "priority": "HIGH",
                "description": "Eligible candidates remained unclaimed for at least 10 minutes. Inspect the scheduler logs, runtime flags and approval; do not alter dates or force a deletion for testing.",
                "tags": [{ "tag": "jira", "value": "NN-4830" }]
              }
            ]
          },
